ded in the task context when `use_task_logical_date` is\nTrue\" — when neither a logical date nor a DagRun `run_after` can be\ndetermined. When a DagRun is present, behaviour is unchanged (the existing\n`run_after` fallback tests still pass).\n\n### Tests\n\nAdded `test_choose_branch_without_logical_date_or_dag_run` to both operator\ntest modules, parametrized over an empty context and a context with explicit\n`None` values. The new tests fail on the previous code with the reported\n`AttributeError` and pass with this change.\n\nBoth full modules run locally (`test_weekday.py` + `test_datetime.py`):\n60 passed.\n\n---\n##### Was generative AI tooling used to co-author this PR?\n\n- [x] Yes (please specify the tool below)\n\nGenerated-by: Muse Spark following [the guidelines](https://github.com/apache/airflow/blob/main/contributing-docs/05_pull_requests.rst#gen-ai-assisted-contributions)\n\n---\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/75434/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/75434/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]]
